<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/28/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue of a sum not exceeding twenty-two billion seven hundred and sixty-two million three hundred and fifty-three thousand seven hundred and thirty ringgit (RM22,762,353,730) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 1994 is hereby authorised, and the said sum is appropriated for the purposes specified in . the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/28/eng@> .
